  "description": "Lights on for the Blackout. Full-sized and race ready. Built on a heat-treated 6000 series aluminum frame with PTS Disc brake mounting and internal cable routing for a clean look and rattle-free rolling at the highest speeds. Add on a state-of-the-art Citizen Carbon fork with 20mm through axles front and rear. All sealed bearings. 2-piece forged alloy 175mm cranks with a 30mm hollow spindle. Kenda Konversion tires speed you up, a Promax disc brake slows you down. Two frames sizes: XL 21\" and XXL 21.5\". Sold without pedals, because we know everyone has their own preferences...\n6061-T6 Heat Treated Alloy PTC Disc Frame w/ Integrated Tapered Headtube, Internal Cable Routing, Smooth Welding & Haro 3D Dropouts w/ Integrated Chain Tensioner\nCitizen Carbon Fork w/ Tapered Alloy Steerer & 20mm Thru-Axle Dropouts\n2-pc Hollow Forged Alloy w/ 30mm Hollow Spindle - 175mm - 44t Alloy Chainring\nLow Flange Alloy 36h, Sealed Bearing, 20mm Thru-Axle Front w/ Low Flange Alloy Disc Rear\nPromax DSK-300 Mechanical Disc Brake, 160mm Rotor\nKenda \"Konversion\" 20 x 1.95\" Front / 20 x 1.75\" Rear",
